        "title": "Governments should spend money on railways rather than roads. To what extent do you agree or disagree with this statement?",
        "status": "published",
        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-F7kpdcoaeoktqkxSG3cl7vg2gAW\"><em><strong>Governments should spend money on railways rather than roads. To what extent do you agree or disagree with this statement?</strong></em></div>\n</div>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 2 - Railways vs Roads Debate&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/essay-structure-logical-framework\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Theo Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></a></strong></span></em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> Hiểu đề &amp; viết Introduction:</strong></span></h3>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NaxWdZVNao0ib4xwAN2lw2pkgJc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Đề Railways vs Roads Debate&nbsp;cho 1 quan điểm:</strong> Ch&iacute;nh phủ n&ecirc;n chi tiền cho đường sắt hơn đường bộ.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MtlDd1BqqoX8sOxAWrEl7vZegke\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Dạng c&acirc;u hỏi:</strong> Bạn đồng &yacute; hay kh&ocirc;ng đồng &yacute; với &yacute; kiến n&agrave;y đến mức độ n&agrave;o?</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XHb7dtkPSoqjObxlJrslKffFg7c\">Dựa v&agrave;o đề b&agrave;i Railways vs Roads Debate&nbsp;v&agrave; c&acirc;u hỏi, ch&uacute;ng ta c&oacute; thể viết được phần Introduction. Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, phần Introduction lu&ocirc;n c&oacute; 2 c&acirc;u:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TWrNdl91rov4N7xzdOTl5k9Mg5c\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C&acirc;u 1:</strong> Paraphrase đề b&agrave;i</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AFhxdRuyZoqGRjxwu1MlDzLng9e\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C&acirc;u 2:</strong> Thesis statement - Trả lời c&acirc;u hỏi</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XVAcdgm94oTPTLxEk2slfzb1gBb\"><em>(*) Bạn học<a href=\"https://rebrand.ly/intro-to-what-extent\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\"> <strong><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\">c&aacute;ch viết Introduction cho dạng To what extent </span></strong></a>ở đ&acirc;y nh&eacute;.</em></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-R1s3dk1wnoQ5c6xmV8Gld5nLgQd\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Gợi &yacute; Paraphrasing</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UckKdEPOUog3txx9P1blXSskgAf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>railway infrastructure<em> (hệ thống đường sắt)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SCsWdUkzcoYtVuxcPHplk4MdgWf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>road development<em> (sự ph&aacute;t triển của đường bộ)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UwLSdoLaWowSbhxwNX2lbLDVghd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>transportation budgets <em>(ng&acirc;n s&aacute;ch d&agrave;nh cho giao th&ocirc;ng)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M5a6d1M1loZMSCxBAWul3kLWgxf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>railway investment<em> (sự đầu tư v&agrave;o đường sắt)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Gợi &yacute; lập luận &amp; ph&acirc;n BODY:</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Pklmddy9Bo7tzyxz8N8lq70Dgyb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FpNbd7IdBoA4Ctx6gxsl4JN5gie\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OWsUdfdiSo5zJSxHBAElqPqPgMf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DnoWda9NLoogFOxHQgvljDWwgQI\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Y0VTdv3RjoVBMUxyY6glDwkugHc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Xxw3dzwzloLfvMx31Ozl4U5Rgdd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GNJ6d5ipHoc8XKxmUm7lK2WGgfe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IbjJdoy4ooQvOuxYcF4lOk6kgMf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TrXedfmpHoDN5oxYJwclLFK5g8d\">\n<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BoHodFLzgoIfzyxCaZAlShJjgye\">\n<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BoHodFLzgoIfzyxCaZAlShJjgye\">\n<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TuMjdHNO7o6RDZxhCF7lLQ1wg0d\">Bạn n&ecirc;n n&oacute;i r&otilde; quan điểm của m&igrave;nh l&agrave; đồng &yacute;, hoặc kh&ocirc;ng đồng &yacute; với quan điểm của đề. Ở đ&acirc;y, theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>&nbsp;với <strong>c&aacute;ch lập luận 40/60</strong>, YouPass sẽ chọn quan điểm '<strong>đồng &yacute;'</strong>, v&igrave; ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh tin rằng <strong>'ch&iacute;nh phủ n&ecirc;n ưu ti&ecirc;n đầu tư đường sắt hơn đường bộ'.</strong></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DmkfdCR21og1VBxjMiYl2A0Igae\"><em>(*) Bạn t&igrave;m hiểu về bản chất của <strong>c&aacute;ch lập luận 40/60</strong> ở b&agrave;i học thử n&agrave;y nh&eacute;:<a href=\"https://rebrand.ly/cach-lap-luan-4060\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\"> <strong><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\">Logic lập luận dạng 'To What Extent'</span></strong></a></em></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PQ1odBJHYoYdQ0xeBuXlNhFwgFf\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, với <strong>c&aacute;ch lập luận 40/60</strong> th&igrave; ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ sắp xếp &yacute; tưởng v&agrave;o 2 BODY như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Dds3dhRj7oTcV7xfcs8ljg6Cg28\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>BODY 1:</strong> M&igrave;nh sẽ b&agrave;n về một số lợi &iacute;ch nhỏ của hệ thống đường bộ.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MzV4dlJopoOmp6xyW1lln5jIgwg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>BODY 2:</strong> Tr&igrave;nh b&agrave;y quan điểm c&aacute; nh&acirc;n rằng hệ thống đường sắt mang lại lợi &iacute;ch đ&aacute;ng kể.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jc2YdlxwyoT072xrbBMl3Cjzggb\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XVlYd5YxvoW8RkxcZbDl2xzTgSb\"><em>(*) Nếu bạn chưa nắm vững về cấu tr&uacute;c đoạn văn v&agrave; logic ph&aacute;t triển &yacute; theo&nbsp;<strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong><strong>&nbsp;</strong>th&igrave; bạn h&atilde;y xem c&aacute;c b&agrave;i học sau trước khi viết b&agrave;i theo gợi &yacute; ở bước 3 nh&eacute;:</em></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OJ5sdtVO1ox5aKxgPeblSr1Mg6V\"><strong><a href=\"https://rebrand.ly/cau-truc-doan-van\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\">Logic sắp xếp th&ocirc;ng tin trong paragraph</span></a></strong></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LG9UdUYsTo2WztxXgnBl4WSVgWh\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/development-reason-impact\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">Logic ph&aacute;t triển core idea bằng Reason v&agrave; Impact</a></span></strong></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KdTydgp5eoK7OdxNpWHldmFogwi\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/development-example\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">Logic ph&aacute;t triển core idea bằng Example</a></span></strong></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HEkZdVl0Loexrnx8bSzlHBRBg3D\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CRT6dLvfRoVbHtxCnc9l7AdygTl\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DqjpdMqWWoiZ5lxsEK7lpzBagSh\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Viết BODY 1: B</strong>&agrave;n về một số lợi &iacute;ch nhỏ của hệ thống đường bộ.</span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Kk5gd8w6foneJkxtmd7ld1C4grP\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OTuvdKP8xofWPhxe3dnljyPXgvd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GGx2dtMsVo2SRMxTaHOlDGY0gIh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OUsndgv96oXwDFxW1FrloHVrgAe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GRTBdEWugofGoixOPJblvMOygNU\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CqPEd28cco0ycmxZHuQlljkHgMe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-T4nldWXyRoUmvgxl7nOldzdAgIf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CizadgB9moHAc1xIKRIlK0EVgAz\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TYRIdhFgWoNmKuxEEpklKyzbgMh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FZHPdYYU5oHSRix4IyWlo1lTgSO\">\n<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WFlOdn0L6o9tGSxuugml62PSg9d\">\n<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-A6ABdum2roKdXNxQrTWlclq5gKd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SLtCd8WGXo2M6TxHo1Ll9lFBgbg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Topic sentence: </strong></span>Kh&ocirc;ng thể phủ nhận rằng hệ thống đường bộ mang lại một số lợi &iacute;ch thiết yếu m&agrave; đường sắt <em>kh&oacute; c&oacute; thể s&aacute;nh bằng (cannot easily match)</em>.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E7IxdrjBMonlnHxp0ohlSKhwguf\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 1:</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TW2Gd7onJopTB4xNFPplMXtRgNf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core idea 1</strong>: Đầu ti&ecirc;n, <em>hệ thống đường bộ (road networks) </em>cho ph&eacute;p <em>sự tiếp cận ngay lập tức (immediate accessibility)</em> c&aacute;c v&ugrave;ng s&acirc;u v&ugrave;ng xa m&agrave; việc x&acirc;y dựng đường sắt l&agrave;<em> kh&ocirc;ng khả thi (impractical)</em>.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Db5ydg5nboQWCrx4chll9cy2guc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Reason: </strong>L&yacute; do l&agrave; đường sắt cần c&oacute; <em>ga (stations)</em> v&agrave; kh&ocirc;ng thể<em> tiếp cận đến mọi ng&oacute;c ng&aacute;ch của đất nước (reach every corner of the country)</em>, trong khi đường bộ c&oacute; thể kết nối trực tiếp với c&aacute;c <em>l&agrave;ng qu&ecirc; (rural villages)</em> v&agrave; <em>cộng đồng n&ocirc;ng d&acirc;n (farming communities)</em> - những nơi phụ thuộc nhiều v&agrave;o <em>phương tiện đường bộ (road transport) </em>trong sinh hoạt h&agrave;ng ng&agrave;y.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-B6PTdH4TRoc3OIxkoxTlzdregLb\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 2:</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SkPOdqNMroKPQPxVCbblTcurgEd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core idea 2:</strong> Ngo&agrave;i ra, đường bộ mang lại <em>sự tiện lợi tận cửa (door-to-door convenience)</em> cho những người cần <em>thời gian linh hoạt (flexible timing)</em> v&agrave; <em>khả năng cơ động/ di chuyển c&aacute; nh&acirc;n (personal mobility)</em>.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HOu6d80yOoOmaVx8HkllyDQxgbe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Impact:</strong> Nhờ đ&oacute;, c&aacute;c gia đ&igrave;nh c&oacute; thể đi lại c&ugrave;ng <em>đồ đạc c&aacute; nh&acirc;n (belongings)</em> bất cứ l&uacute;c n&agrave;o m&agrave; kh&ocirc;ng <em>bị r&agrave;ng buộc (be restricted)</em> bởi lịch tr&igrave;nh cố định của <em>hệ thống giao th&ocirc;ng c&ocirc;ng cộng (public transportation systems)</em>.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Viết BODY 2: </strong>Tr&igrave;nh b&agrave;y quan điểm c&aacute; nh&acirc;n rằng hệ thống đường sắt mang lại lợi &iacute;ch đ&aacute;ng kể.</span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KrtVdtupRoKL6sxjDB2lsqewgkf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IpmcdM2KVo20yvx1AcclbEoFgNe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WdeNdWsDkoHkxfxFq99lekOpgte\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Zq8Ed5ZPxoJixmxjWwPlsAd9gQ8\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Q9QVdRGxLozW5JxLNrOlZt4TgTh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ec7GdL8hOopk25xWQG2llrpWgfd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-S88bdXvGSorowHxwaxulSLSbgsh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-An7YdeKksognslxRwyBlLIxig1c\">\n<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MTcmdZobEoTmv6x3FLVlPSQfgzd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IQk7dtFfcodO74x8BqAlUFO8gug\">\n<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Pz3Xdb2aLo9ZTbxB301lvayRgjh\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Topic sentence: </strong></span>Tuy nhi&ecirc;n, những ưu điểm của ph&aacute;t triển đường sắt lại quan trọng hơn nhiều.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ebs1dd7o8o3cFsxrsVllTgU6gXf\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 1:</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RSt7ddGaWoOwjCx9Skgl46BugJd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core idea 1: </strong>Đặc biệt, t&agrave;u hỏa g&oacute;p phần lớn v&agrave;o <em>sự bền vững của m&ocirc;i trường (environmental sustainability)</em> nhờ lượng <em>kh&iacute; thải (emissions)</em> thấp hơn rất nhiều cho mỗi <em>h&agrave;nh kh&aacute;ch (passenger)</em>.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JZFqdddDPoVeXXxTvTXlkKa0g4z\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Example: </strong>V&iacute; dụ, một t&agrave;u c&oacute; thể chở h&agrave;ng trăm người c&ugrave;ng l&uacute;c, giảm đ&aacute;ng kể <em>lượng kh&iacute; thải carbon (carbon footprint)</em> so với h&agrave;ng chục &ocirc; t&ocirc; ri&ecirc;ng lẻ đi c&ugrave;ng qu&atilde;ng đường.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HwoCd9Vg2oKIaPxdUn5lXca5gwc\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 2:</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MeJGdaQoAokGZMxHxSQliB4rgSc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core idea 2:</strong> Hơn nữa, đường sắt c&oacute; <em>sức chứa (capacity)</em><strong> </strong>v&agrave;<strong> </strong><em>hiệu quả (efficiency) vượt trội (superior)</em>, nhất l&agrave; v&agrave;o <em>những giờ cao điểm (rush hours)</em> khi h&agrave;ng ngh&igrave;n người cần di chuyển.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UjYidxwbDoFKkpxald5lPTfmgNb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Impact:</strong> Kết quả l&agrave; <em>hệ thống vận tải c&ocirc;ng cộng (mass transit system)</em> n&agrave;y kh&ocirc;ng chỉ giảm <em>tắc nghẽn giao th&ocirc;ng (traffic congestion)</em> m&agrave; c&ograve;n c&oacute; lịch tr&igrave;nh ổn định hơn việc đi đường, vốn thường bị ảnh hưởng bởi <em>t&igrave;nh trạng giao th&ocirc;ng kh&oacute; lường (unpredictable traffic conditions)</em>.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>5.</strong><strong> Viết Conclusion:</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QkOnd9VeToRuWPxTqkUlIuw9gif\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MGPwd7mnhojSSExL2sIl4MDVgae\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MGPwd7mnhojSSExL2sIl4MDVgae\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jx3IdxsyToocMyxrcHBlR5M4gTb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Z215dilK9oetfOxPDFol02JKgkg\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JRbGdLxfwoyo3LxfaWvlKYZxgLh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-S41gdx1Yho0RQhxH1Zclco4KgPH\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MDkodyWDGo2nbTx3llNlDkiTgye\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Bx6adWi8AoLDF0xo9FAl8FSSgig\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Y8TJdaqR0oT0n0xPP4JlvEIWg8e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Wx2adUP2GoZ4bwxAGtSlFbGzg5e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HhjYd198Qo0hYvxQQmNlpg7jg9b\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Bạn h&atilde;y viết Conclusion bằng c&aacute;ch <strong>t&oacute;m tắt c&aacute;c luận điểm ch&iacute;nh v&agrave; khẳng định lại quan điểm</strong> của m&igrave;nh nh&eacute;!</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZiDZdDL6GoLynJx2cO4lvJH3gZc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FT9sdjLwhocuhWx7R1MlwzVtgwd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Gợi &yacute; Paraphrasing</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RxvsdCAE9oLRWoxdTpelYWANgee\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>convenience <em>(sự tiện lợi)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MD9ddseojodMEbxmBtDlCYwzgPd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>environmental benefits <em>(lợi &iacute;ch về m&ocirc;i trường)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IEASd3X8DoczenxYDHUlcaRKgve\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">mass transportation <em>(vận chuyển c&ocirc;ng cộng)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 1500,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WNZidLPGRoXWyrx2wqflo1sWgSe\">Opinions are divided on whether governments should prioritize railway infrastructure over road development in their transportation budgets. Although investing in roads offers certain practical benefits, I believe that railway investment should take precedence due to its superior long-term advantages.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 17941,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 1501,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YLe5dkaM0onPvGxI5QflTAFkgFe\"><strong>Admittedly, road networks provide some essential benefits that railways cannot easily match.</strong> <span style=\"color: rgb(22, 145, 121);\">Firstly, roads offer immediate accessibility to remote areas where railway infrastructure would be impractical to build. This is because railways require specific stations and cannot reach every corner of the country, whereas roads can connect directly to rural villages and farming communities that rely heavily on road transport for their daily needs. </span><span style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\">Additionally, roads provide door-to-door convenience for individuals who value flexible timing and personal mobility. As a result, families can travel with their belongings at any time without being constrained by fixed schedules that public transportation systems impose.</span></div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 17941,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 1502,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 2",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WQm0dGa4aoJFgzx99trlg7bLgvf\"><strong>However, the advantages of railway development far outweigh these benefits. </strong><span style=\"color: rgb(22, 145, 121);\">Most importantly, trains contribute significantly to environmental sustainability by producing much lower emissions per passenger. For instance, a single train can carry hundreds of people at once, dramatically reducing the carbon footprint compared to dozens of individual cars making the same journey. </span><span style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\">Furthermore, railways offer superior passenger capacity and efficiency, especially during rush hours when thousands of commuters need transportation. Consequently, this mass transit system not only reduces traffic congestion but also provides more reliable scheduling than road travel, which is often disrupted by unpredictable traffic conditions.</span></div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 17941,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 1503,
            "sort": 4,
            "name": "Conclusion",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CWs7d9lMIoPM8bx6GQSlG1qEg7g\">In conclusion, while roads provide certain practical advantages in terms of accessibility and convenience, I believe governments should prioritize railway investment because of its environmental benefits and superior capacity for mass transportation.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 17941,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          }
        ],
